00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:32.325 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le jugement va à l'encontre

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:33.493 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du mouvement MoiAussi et duRappr

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:34.661 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'accompagnement des victimes,

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:35.829 size:53% position:73% line:53%
selon les oppositions.

00:01:33.827 --> 00:01:36.963 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ISABELLE MELANÇON, porte-parole

00:01:34.995 --> 00:01:38.131 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PLQ en matière de cond. féminine

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:39.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
s outrée. Je suis

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:40.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
