00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:41.568 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec un jugement comme celui-ci

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:42.736 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'on va rebâtir la confiance,

00:01:40.734 --> 00:01:44.071 size:53% position:73% line:53%
justement envers le système

00:01:41.902 --> 00:01:45.205 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de justice, mais a

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:46.373 size:53% position:73% line:53%
envers les victimes.

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:47.507 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ALEXANDRE LEDUC, porte-parole

00:01:45.539 --> 00:01:48.675 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de QS en matière de justice

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:49.809 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le signal que ça envoie à la

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:53.680 size:53% position:73% line:53%
société, c'est com

00:01:49.009 --> 00:01:54.814 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un bon emploi, si on est

00:01:50.143 --> 00:01:55.982 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans la bonne classe sociale,

00:01:54.181 --> 00:01:57.150 size:53% position:73% line:53%
on peut espèce de...

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:59.786 size:53% position:73% line:53%
